From 1923980a17ea0d6c063f13db3cd99c913c97b209 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben van der Linde <ruben@conduction.nl>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:23:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(humaniq): build configuration-store [skip ci]

The Sjablonen setup step (REQ-FTS-007) and the store routes the Marketplace
page (REQ-FTS-006) calls: store#search and store#install, bound to
OpenRegister's GenericStoreController through the guarded
Bootstrap::aliasStoreController call, so humaniq holds no store code.
SetupTemplates lists and installs the step's sets through that same
controller; SetupController reports the step, records "No templates" as an
answer and installs the picked sets, keeping the step open when one fails.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
